In all other respects, the judgment and award of the Tribunal remains unaltered;
iii) The claimant is entitled for an enhanced compensation of `30,000/- with interest at 7% p.a.
from the date of petition till its realization, in addition to the compensation awarded by the Tribunal;
iv) Respondent No.2 - insurer is directed to deposit the said compensation together with accrued interest within a period of six weeks NC: 2025:KHC:24980 HC-KAR from the date of receipt of a copy of this judgment;
v) Upon such deposit, the entire enhanced compensation together with interest accrued thereupon be disbursed to the claimant;
vi) The Registry to draw the modified award accordingly;
vii) Records be transmitted to the Tribunal forthwith.

